{%- comment -%}
  GPSR (Art. 19, EU Regulation 2023/988) safety / responsible-party notice,
  legally mandatory on every PDP. Rendered as a sibling info tab from
  sections/main-product.liquid (data-info-tab="gpsr" / data-info-panel="gpsr"),
  the exact same generic tab mechanism the shipping tab uses (theme.js reads
  [data-info-tab]/[data-info-panel] by matching key, no per-tab JS needed).

  shop.email is passed into gpsr.responsible_line as a t-param so the contact
  address can never drift from the real mailbox if it changes.

  MANUFACTURER PLACEHOLDER: gpsr.manufacturer_line says "available on request"
  until the real manufacturer identity is sourced from the supplier and used
  to replace this line. Do not invent a name.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign gpsr_email = settings.biz_email | default: shop.email -%}
<p>{{ 'gpsr.responsible_line' | t: email: gpsr_email }}</p>
<p>{{ 'gpsr.manufacturer_line' | t }}</p>
<p>{{ 'gpsr.safety_line' | t }}</p>
